  m_text: '"The following message is transmitted at the request of the King County Sheriff''s Office. This is not a test.


    A Civil Danger Warning is in effect for the Seattle metropolitan area. Authorities reported a rapidly spreading biological hazard. Affected individuals exhibit extreme, unprovoked violence. The pathogen is highly contagious through fluid contact.


    Shelter in place immediately. Major interstates are closed. Lock all doors, turn off lights, and remain completely silent. The National Guard has been deployed. Lethal force is authorized."'
